{"4228620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Among the Stars", "steam_appid": 4228620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/extras/d14eea41444ecdcfddfd2384ad2d5a15.avif?t=1786548321\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to LATS! This is a game about spaceship customisation and scavenging through the vestiges of your enemies to manage to survive and become stronger to find and salvage your lost technologies.<br><br>Pack your ship with turrets to unleash hell, or create a massive railgun atomising anything in it's path. Overwhelm your enemies with drones and explosives. Develop new technologies by analyzing acquired equipment and optimize your vessel until there isn't a single atom of space left untouched.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/extras/41bf8c5c0fba8a0ebb349505665488b7.avif?t=1786548321\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature multi-layered ship customisation with every pixel counting toward your final creation. Everything is linked together and destructible. Every pixel has mass and is impactful. Manage your capabilities and the relation between every part of your ship to optimise the usage of your resources and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/extras/e28ceb71c515baa31d223c2ed0604281.avif?t=1786548321\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/extras/d14eea41444ecdcfddfd2384ad2d5a15.avif?t=1786548321\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to LATS! This is a game about spaceship customisation and scavenging through the vestiges of your enemies to manage to survive and become stronger to find and salvage your lost technologies.<br><br>Pack your ship with turrets to unleash hell, or create a massive railgun atomising anything in it's path. Overwhelm your enemies with drones and explosives. Develop new technologies by analyzing acquired equipment and optimize your vessel until there isn't a single atom of space left untouched.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/extras/41bf8c5c0fba8a0ebb349505665488b7.avif?t=1786548321\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature multi-layered ship customisation with every pixel counting toward your final creation. Everything is linked together and destructible. Every pixel has mass and is impactful. Manage your capabilities and the relation between every part of your ship to optimise the usage of your resources and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/extras/e28ceb71c515baa31d223c2ed0604281.avif?t=1786548321\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Are you ready to annihilate every, single, entity from the observable universe? I hope so, because you don't have a choice. It's you, or them- Get your battle stations ready, rev the engine and get ready to engage the enemies. Try and stop them.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/79866d831e3577e734a4d5d8214ccd3e89882947/header.jpg?t=1786548321", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/3789bddceeb004f9ef5a7a5912877890de6d76e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786548321", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/3789bddceeb004f9ef5a7a5912877890de6d76e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786548321", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Craibos"], "publishers": ["Craibos"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/a0d22ada17feeb3bb37ec0ebfc296a2bded6e114/ss_a0d22ada17feeb3bb37ec0ebfc296a2bded6e114.600x338.jpg?t=1786548321", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/a0d22ada17feeb3bb37ec0ebfc296a2bded6e114/ss_a0d22ada17feeb3bb37ec0ebfc296a2bded6e114.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786548321"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/79ad320bcabd1a4685aa77f889b052509298ec39/ss_79ad320bcabd1a4685aa77f889b052509298ec39.600x338.jpg?t=1786548321", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/79ad320bcabd1a4685aa77f889b052509298ec39/ss_79ad320bcabd1a4685aa77f889b052509298ec39.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786548321"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228620/7c1219e9f7d5f36cd9eae193160c95fbd65d1751/ss_7c1219e9f7d5f36cd9eae193160c95fbd65d17